===persian===

گوشِ من زمزمه‌ای می‌شنود...
تو لبانت خاموش...
تو نگاهت هوسِ باران را...
روی برگِ تشنه می‌بیند...
تو... نگاهت در من آتش افروخت...
هَوسِ بوسه... لبانم را سوخت...
۱۳۷۸

===machine===

My ear is hearing a murmur...
and your lips are silent...
Your gaze sees the rain's craving...
on the thirsty leaf...
You... your gaze lit a fire in me...
the craving for a kiss... burned my lips...
1378

===lantern===

My ear is hearing a murmur
and your lips are silent.
Your looking sees the rain's craving
on the thirsty leaf.
You — your looking lit a fire in me,
and the craving for a kiss burned my lips...

1378

